# Data is never committed. Two separate reasons:
#  * data/raw/ holds third-party datasets that must NOT be redistributed - their
#    licences differ and one (NYT county series) is non-commercial only. See
#    docs/DATA_ACQUISITION.md for retrieval instructions and checksums.
#  * data/interim/ and the demo pipeline's data/ are regenerable outputs.
# Derived results (results/wbe/) ARE committed: they are the evidence for the
# published findings and are small enough to version.
